second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the region of Forum Iulii?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 166, \"text\": \"Cividale del Friuli Cividale del Friuli ( (locally ); ; ) is a town and \\\"comune\\\" in the Province of Udine, part of the Friuli-Venezia Giulia region of northern Italy.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d00\", \"start\": 167, \"end\": 295, \"text\": \"The town above sea-level in the foothills of the eastern Alps, by rail from the city of Udine and close to the Slovenian border.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d00\", \"start\": 296, \"end\": 372, \"text\": \"It is situated on the river Natisone, which forms a picturesque ravine here.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d00\", \"start\": 373, \"end\": 496, \"text\": \"Formerly an important regional power, it is today a quiet, small town that attracts tourists thanks to its medieval center.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d00\", \"start\": 497, \"end\": 580, \"text\": \"Archaeological findings reveal that the area was first settled by Veneti and Celts.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 151, \"text\": \"is required to create user profiles to send advertising , or to track the user on a website or across several websites for similar marketing purposes .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d01\", \"start\": 152, \"end\": 466, \"text\": \"Manage options Manage services Manage { vendor_count } vendors Read more about these purposes Accept Deny View preferences Save preferences View preferences { title } { title } { title } Manage consent Italy home » Friuli-Venezia Giulia Tourist & Travel Information » Cividale del Friuli : Tourist and Travel Guide\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 30, \"text\": \"quiet and safe even at night .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02\", \"start\": 31, \"end\": 81, \"text\": \"FOOD Here is where I could end up writing a book .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02\", \"start\": 82, \"end\": 98, \"text\": \"Maybe I should !\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02\", \"start\": 99, \"end\": 100, \"text\": \"!\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02\", \"start\": 101, \"end\": 209, \"text\": \"I always say that there is no Italian cuisine as such and it would be more correct to say Italian cuisines .\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02\", \"start\": 210, \"end\": 285, \"text\": \"What you eat in Sicily is completely different than what you eat in Milan !\"}, \"D3S7\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02\", \"start\": 286, \"end\": 401, \"text\": \"I must admit that I did not know much about food from Friuli-Venezia Giulia and I fell completely in love with it .\"}, \"D3S8\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02\", \"start\": 402, \"end\": 455, \"text\": \"In our 3 week stay , we never had a single bad meal .\"}, \"D3S9\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02\", \"start\": 456, \"end\": 466, \"text\": \"Every meal\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 169, \"text\": \"Voghera Voghera (Vogherese dialect of Emilian: \\\"Vughera\\\"; Latin: \\\"Forum Iulii Iriensium\\\") is a town and \\\"comune\\\" in the Province of Pavia in the Italian region Lombardy.\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03\", \"start\": 170, \"end\": 207, \"text\": \"The population was 39,374 as of 2017.\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03\", \"start\": 208, \"end\": 286, \"text\": \"It is the third most populated town in the province, after Pavia and Vigevano.\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03\", \"start\": 287, \"end\": 377, \"text\": \"It is located 30 km south-southwest of that city, on the Staffora (a tributary of the Po).\"}, \"D4S5\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03\", \"start\": 378, \"end\": 491, \"text\": \"It is the main town of Oltrepò Pavese, and is an important rail and road hub as well as a renowned wine producer.\"}, \"D4S6\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03\", \"start\": 492, \"end\": 555, \"text\": \"Known in ancient times as Iria, the town took its name from the\"}, \"D5S1\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 77, \"text\": \"This is an underground sight , so we did not visit it – I am claustrophobic !\"}, \"D5S2\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04\", \"start\": 78, \"end\": 181, \"text\": \"On a side street alongside the bar is an unimpressive door which you can open onto the Ipogeo Celtico .\"}, \"D5S3\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04\", \"start\": 182, \"end\": 264, \"text\": \"This is a series of rock chambers , or grottoes , carved close to the cliff face .\"}, \"D5S4\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04\", \"start\": 265, \"end\": 325, \"text\": \"No-one knows how old the caves are , who dug them , or why .\"}, \"D5S5\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04\", \"start\": 326, \"end\": 433, \"text\": \"As the name suggests , some think this is a pre-Roman Celtic site , perhaps intended for burials or rites .\"}, \"D5S6\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04\", \"start\": 434, \"end\": 499, \"text\": \"Longobard Temple Continuing along Via Monastero Maggiore from the\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Forum Iulii\", \"scope\": \"region\", \"claim\": \"The region of Forum Iulii is Friuli-Venezia Giulia.\", \"answer\": \"Friuli-Venezia Giulia\", \"quote\": \"Cividale del Friuli Cividale del Friuli ( (locally ); ; ) is a town and \\\"comune\\\" in the Province of Udine, part of the Friuli-Venezia Giulia region of northern Italy.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03:c0\", \"entity\": \"Forum Iulii\", \"scope\": \"region\", \"claim\": \"The region of Forum Iulii is Lombardy.\", \"answer\": \"Lombardy\", \"quote\": \"Voghera Voghera (Vogherese dialect of Emilian: \\\"Vughera\\\"; Latin: \\\"Forum Iulii Iriensium\\\") is a town and \\\"comune\\\" in the Province of Pavia in the Italian region Lombardy.\", \"original_document_number\": 4}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Friuli-Venezia Giulia\", \"Lombardy\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Friuli-Venezia Giulia\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Lombardy\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
